51f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"儀歸而詐疾，待齊、秦之交合乃朝。","note_content_jianti_auto":"仪归而诈疾，待齐、秦之交合乃朝。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":64,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf1f-db0e-11ef-a480-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"朝，直遙翻。使，疏吏翻。東西曰廣，南北曰袤。廣，古曠翻，又讀如字。袤，音茂。","note_content_jianti_auto":"朝，直遥翻。使，疏吏翻。东西曰广，南北曰袤。广，古旷翻，又读如字。袤，音茂。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":93,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf23-db0e-11ef-9eed-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf27-db0e-11ef-a4a0-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf28-db0e-11ef-ba9b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：十二行本「力」作「兵」；乙十一行本同；孔本同。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：十二行本「力」作「兵」；乙十一行本同；孔本同。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf26-db0e-11ef-9076-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":142,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf25-db0e-11ef-b37c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf2c-db0e-11ef-9636-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"魏","people_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf2d-db0e-11ef-b0b0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"長，知丈翻。按史記·樗里子傳，庶長章，姓魏。","note_content_jianti_auto":"长，知丈翻。按史记·樗里子传，庶长章，姓魏。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":218,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf2b-db0e-11ef-959f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"8c65cf0e-db0e-11ef-b2c1-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"gài","source_anchor_text":"不聽使屈匄帥師伐秦","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":201,"text":"匄","tongjian_id":"c45faf1a-a47a-5df8-8c5c-c56bdefda1bb"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"宋","place_name_jianti_auto":"宋","resolved_place_entity_id":354,"start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf35-db0e-11ef-b6f7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"容斋随笔/陈轸之说疏","excerpts":[{"context_after":"。轸又劝曰：“不如因赂之以一名都，与之并兵而攻齐，是我亡...","context_before":"...地，绝齐未晚。”是轸不深计齐之可绝与否，但以得地为意耳。","source_end_index":151,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8fed7122-356b-41db-8ed9-9e12fe5b2bb1","source_start_index":141,"source_text":"及秦负约，楚王欲攻之"},{"context_after":"此策尤乖谬不义。且秦加亡道于我，乃欲赂以地，齐本与国，楚...","context_before":"...深计齐之可绝与否，但以得地为意耳。及秦负约，楚王欲攻之。","source_end_index":190,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8fed7122-356b-41db-8ed9-9e12fe5b2bb1","source_start_index":152,"source_text":"轸又劝曰：“不如因赂之以一名都，与之并兵而攻齐，是我亡地于秦，取偿于齐也。”"}],"path":"随笔/卷九/陈轸之说疏","source_name":"容斋随笔"},{"display_title":"容斋随笔/战国自取亡","excerpts":[{"context_after":"，不能取偿，身遭囚辱以死。赵以上党之地，代韩受兵，利令智...","context_before":"...孙沮气，孑孑自保，终堕秦计，束手为虏。怀王贪商於六百里，","source_end_index":303,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"1509ccdd-dd12-435e-a66e-d1a5b3e173e1","source_start_index":289,"source_text":"受诈张仪，失其名都，丧其甲士"}],"path":"随笔/卷十/战国自取亡","source_name":"容斋随笔"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/八、南阳府（卷五十一）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"裴骃曰：有商城在於中，故曰商於。道元曰：丹水经内乡、丹水...","context_before":"商於城[在县西。本秦地，","source_end_index":25,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"14556728-c7d1-5599-ad4c-7fab5bb5eb52","source_start_index":12,"source_text":"张仪以商於六百里之地诳楚。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/八、南阳府（卷五十一）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/二、西安府下（卷五十四）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"。汉置商县，属弘农郡。后汉属京兆尹。晋属上洛郡。后魏皇兴...","context_before":"...邑，契所封也。战国时为商于地。盖近南阳之界，秦商君封此，","source_end_index":49,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8eeef47e-e247-5108-a54e-816d9dd1bfc6","source_start_index":41,"source_text":"张仪以绐楚怀王也"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/二、西安府下（卷五十四）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"張儀詳墮車，不朝三月。楚王聞之，曰：「儀以寡人絕齊未甚邪？」乃使勇士宋遺借宋之符，北罵齊王。齊王大怒，折節以事秦，齊、秦之交合。張儀乃朝，見楚使者曰：「子何不受地？從某至某，廣袤六里。」使者怒，還報楚王。楚王大怒，欲發兵而攻秦。陳軫曰：「軫可發口言乎？攻之不如因賂之以一名都，與之幷力而攻齊，是我亡地於秦，取償於齊也。今王已絕於齊而責欺於秦，是吾合齊、秦之交而來天下之兵也，國必大傷矣！」楚王不聽，使屈匄帥師伐秦。秦亦發兵使庶長章擊之。","content_fanyi":"张仪假装从车上跌下来摔伤，三个月不上朝。楚怀王听说张仪不上朝的消息后，说：“张仪大概是认为寡人与齐国断交得还不够彻底吧？”于是派勇士宋遗借了宋国的符节，北上到齐国去辱骂齐王。齐王大怒，只得委屈自己事奉秦国，齐国与秦国便交好联合了。张仪这才上朝，召见楚国使者说：“您怎么还不接受土地呢？从某地到某地，方圆六里。”使者大怒，回来报告楚怀王。楚怀王大怒，想调集军队攻打秦国。陈轸说：“我可以开口讲话吗？攻打秦国还不如趁机用一座名都贿赂秦国，与它合力攻打齐国，这样我们虽然在秦国损失了土地，却可以从齐国取得补偿。现在大王已经与齐国绝交，又去责备秦国欺骗我们，这样等于促使齐国、秦国结交而招来天下的军队，国家必定大受损伤！”楚王不听，派将军屈匄率领军队攻打秦国。秦国也派魏章出任庶长，率兵迎击楚军。","content_jianti_auto":"张仪详堕车，不朝三月。楚王闻之，曰：「仪以寡人绝齐未甚邪？」乃使勇士宋遗借宋之符，北骂齐王。齐王大怒，折节以事秦，齐、秦之交合。张仪乃朝，见楚使者曰：「子何不受地？从某至某，广袤六里。」使者怒，还报楚王。楚王大怒，欲发兵而攻秦。陈轸曰：「轸可发口言乎？攻之不如因赂之以一名都，与之幷力而攻齐，是我亡地于秦，取偿于齐也。今王已绝于齐而责欺于秦，是吾合齐、秦之交而来天下之兵也，国必大伤矣！」楚王不听，使屈匄帅师伐秦。秦亦发兵使庶长章击之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":245,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第三 (周紀三) / 赧王上 / 二年 / 第 3 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf0e-db0e-11ef-b2c1-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-313},"tongjian_id":"8c65cf0e-db0e-11ef-b2c1-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":7},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"宋","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"徐廣","people_name_jianti_auto":"徐广","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"8c9b04e9-db0e-11ef-8b05-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"鹽氏","place_name_jianti_auto":"盐氏","place_note":"山西运城","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8c9b04ea-db0e-11ef-abdd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鹽城","place_name_jianti_auto":"盐城","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"8c9b04eb-db0e-11ef-8120-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蒲州","place_name_jianti_auto":"蒲州","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"8c9b04ec-db0e-11ef-8322-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"安邑縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"安邑县","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"8c9b04ed-db0e-11ef-9e2b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鹽氏","place_name_jianti_auto":"盐氏","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"8c9b04ee-db0e-11ef-a617-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"括地志：鹽氏故城，一名司鹽城，在蒲州安邑縣，掌鹽池之官，因稱鹽氏。徐廣曰：「鹽」，一作「監」。","note_content_jianti_auto":"括地志：盐氏故城，一名司盐城，在蒲州安邑县，掌盐池之官，因称盐氏。徐广曰：「盐」，一作「监」。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"8c9b04e8-db0e-11ef-98d7-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8c9b04f1-db0e-11ef-80a9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"8c9b04f2-db0e-11ef-97f7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"封陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"封陵","place_note":"山西芮城風陵渡","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8c9b04f3-db0e-11ef-849d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"韓","place_name_jianti_auto":"韩","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"8c9b04f4-db0e-11ef-b6b0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"武遂","place_name_jianti_auto":"武遂","place_note":"山西垣曲东南","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"8c9b04f5-db0e-11ef-9b35-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"十二年，秦取魏封陵，又取韓武遂，今皆歸之以和。","note_content_jianti_auto":"十二年，秦取魏封陵，又取韩武遂，今皆归之以和。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"8c9b04f0-db0e-11ef-a10c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"宋","place_name_jianti_auto":"宋","resolved_place_entity_id":354,"start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"8c9b04fa-db0e-11ef-87fc-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/二、平阳府（卷四十一）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"九年，秦复取我武遂。十六年，秦与我河外及武遂。釐王六年，...","context_before":"...者，以先王墓在平阳，而秦之武遂去之七十里也。《韩世家》：","source_end_index":81,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"d3b7946a-d1e5-5ded-882a-80eef36c7312","source_start_index":69,"source_text":"襄王六年，秦复与我武遂。"},{"context_after":"釐王六年，与秦武遂地二百里。又《秦纪》：武王四年，涉河城...","context_before":"...《韩世家》：襄王六年，秦复与我武遂。九年，秦复取我武遂。","source_end_index":104,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"d3b7946a-d1e5-5ded-882a-80eef36c7312","source_start_index":91,"source_text":"十六年，秦与我河外及武遂。"},{"context_after":"亦谓之封谷。《正义》：封陵在蒲阪河曲中。《索隐》云：《纪...","context_before":"...曰封陵。《史记》：魏襄王十六年，秦拔我蒲坂、阳晋、封陵。","source_end_index":64,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"eff834c0-7e98-5b05-aa1e-8ab347e93c79","source_start_index":48,"source_text":"二十年，秦复与我河外及封陵以和。"},{"context_after":"汉有司盐都尉治此，因名司盐城。或曰：唐大历中，于县西南三...","context_before":"司盐城[县西二十里。《括地志》：故盐氏城也。","source_end_index":57,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"90e12588-878d-52be-9603-b06d54ec25a3","source_start_index":22,"source_text":"《秦纪》：昭襄王十一年，齐、韩、魏、赵、宋、中山，共攻秦，至盐氏而还。"}],"path":"山西方舆纪要/二、平阳府（卷四十一）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"2齊、韓、魏、趙、宋同擊秦，至鹽氏而還。秦與韓武遂、與魏封陵以和。","content_fanyi":"齐国、韩国、魏国、赵国、宋国一同出兵攻打秦国，进至盐氏邑后各自班师撤回。秦国把武遂归还给韩国，把封陵归还给魏国，以此讲和。","content_jianti_auto":"2齐、韩、魏、赵、宋同击秦，至盐氏而还。秦与韩武遂、与魏封陵以和。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":304,"number":2,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第四 (周紀四) / 赧王中 / 十九年 / 第 2 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c9b04e7-db0e-11ef-8dad-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-296},"tongjian_id":"8c9b04e7-db0e-11ef-8dad-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":8},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"宋","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"無後，猶言未晚。","note_content_jianti_auto":"无后，犹言未晚。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":84,"tongjian_id":"8ca1d4c1-db0e-11ef-abf4-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[{"relation_type":"forward_reference","source_end_index":9,"source_start_index":3,"source_text":"見下二十九年","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8ca437c4-db0e-11ef-98c3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"桀宋","place_name_jianti_auto":"桀宋","place_note":"都睢阳，河南商丘","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8ca1d4c4-db0e-11ef-831f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"桀宋，見下二十九年。","note_content_jianti_auto":"桀宋，见下二十九年。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":118,"tongjian_id":"8ca1d4c3-db0e-11ef-b05a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"古人有言曰：「自卑者人尊之。」","note_content_jianti_auto":"古人有言曰：「自卑者人尊之。」","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":174,"tongjian_id":"8ca1d4c6-db0e-11ef-954c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"歸帝號而不稱也。復，扶又翻，又音如字。","note_content_jianti_auto":"归帝号而不称也。复，扶又翻，又音如字。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":188,"tongjian_id":"8ca1d4c7-db0e-11ef-a5cc-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"太嶽","people_name_jianti_auto":"太岳","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8ca1d4c9-db0e-11ef-b141-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"禹","people_name_jianti_auto":"禹","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8ca1d4ca-db0e-11ef-a045-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"呂侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"吕侯","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"8ca1d4cb-db0e-11ef-afa9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"姓譜曰：太嶽爲禹心呂之臣，故封呂侯，後因以爲氏。古字脊骨之膂本作「呂」。","note_content_jianti_auto":"姓谱曰：太岳为禹心吕之臣，故封吕侯，后因以为氏。古字脊骨之膂本作「吕」。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":199,"tongjian_id":"8ca1d4c8-db0e-11ef-bf70-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"去，羌呂翻，除也；後以義推。","note_content_jianti_auto":"去，羌吕翻，除也；后以义推。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":209,"tongjian_id":"8ca1d4cd-db0e-11ef-aeb4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"宋","place_name_jianti_auto":"宋","resolved_place_entity_id":354,"start_index":138,"tongjian_id":"8ca1d4dd-db0e-11ef-8415-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"容斋随笔/博古图","excerpts":[{"context_after":"，岂有肯自称侯之理？其可笑四也。汉梁山鋗之铭曰“梁山铜造...","context_before":"...各数百年，岂必当湣王时从亲乎？且湣王在齐诸王中最为骄暴，","source_end_index":550,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"00bf2bd9-6de7-4c4b-8c21-cd4d8f6370ee","source_start_index":546,"source_text":"尝称东帝"}],"path":"随笔/卷十四/博古图","source_name":"容斋随笔"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/五、青州府（卷三十五）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"秦灭齐，因故城置齐郡，其后项羽封田都为齐王。汉有天下，封...","context_before":"...郭门也，田氏杀阚止于郭关，是矣。其章华东门，则齐宫门也。","source_end_index":536,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"47a90a9e-6503-5c01-9052-055c764633d9","source_start_index":512,"source_text":"湣王二十六年，苏代自燕入齐，见于章华东门，是矣。"}],"path":"山东方舆纪要/五、青州府（卷三十五）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"1冬，十月，秦王稱西帝，遣使立齊王爲東帝，欲約與共伐趙。蘇代自燕來，齊王曰：「秦使魏冉致帝，子以爲何如？」對曰：「願王受之而勿稱也。秦稱之，天下安之，王乃稱之，無後也。秦稱之，天下惡之，王因勿稱，以收天下，此大資也。且伐趙孰與伐桀宋利？今王不如釋帝以收天下之望，發兵以伐桀宋，宋舉則楚、趙、梁、衞皆懼矣。是我以名尊秦而令天下憎之，所謂以卑爲尊也。」齊王從之，稱帝二日而復歸之。十二月，呂禮自齊入秦。秦王亦去帝，復稱王。","content_fanyi":"冬季，十月，秦昭襄王自称西帝，派遣使臣拥立齐湣王为东帝，想与齐国约定共同攻打赵国。苏代从燕国来到齐国，齐湣王问他：“秦王派魏冉来约请我为东帝，您认为怎么样？”苏代回答说：“希望大王接受称帝的名号，但不要立即称帝。秦王称帝后，如果天下安然无事，大王那时再称帝也不算晚。秦王称帝后，如果天下人都厌恶他，大王就因此不称帝，借以收揽天下人心，这是极大的利益啊。况且，攻打赵国与攻打有夏桀一样恶名的宋国相比，哪个更有利可图呢？现在大王不如放弃帝号，以赢得诸侯的信任，然后发兵攻打暴虐的宋国；宋国一旦被攻下，楚国、赵国、魏国、卫国就都会恐惧。这样，我们以尊崇秦国为名，实际上是让天下人憎恨秦国，这就是所说的以卑为尊啊。”齐湣王听从了他的建议，称帝两天后便归还帝号，又改称为王。十二月，吕礼从齐国回到秦国。秦昭襄王也去掉帝号，重新称王。","content_jianti_auto":"1冬，十月，秦王称西帝，遣使立齐王为东帝，欲约与共伐赵。苏代自燕来，齐王曰：「秦使魏冉致帝，子以为何如？」对曰：「愿王受之而勿称也。秦称之，天下安之，王乃称之，无后也。秦称之，天下恶之，王因勿称，以收天下，此大资也。且伐赵孰与伐桀宋利？今王不如释帝以收天下之望，发兵以伐桀宋，宋举则楚、赵、梁、衞皆惧矣。是我以名尊秦而令天下憎之，所谓以卑为尊也。」齐王从之，称帝二日而复归之。十二月，吕礼自齐入秦。秦王亦去帝，复称王。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":327,"number":1,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第四 (周紀四) / 赧王中 / 二十七年 / 第 1 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8ca1d4bf-db0e-11ef-85db-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-288},"tongjian_id":"8ca1d4bf-db0e-11ef-85db-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":9},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"宋","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"劉向","people_name_jianti_auto":"刘向","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8ca437c6-db0e-11ef-9347-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"陸璣","people_name_jianti_auto":"陆玑","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"8ca437c7-db0e-11ef-b56f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"「𪄟」，劉向說苑作「鸇」。字林曰：鷂屬。陸璣曰：鸇似鷂，青黃色，燕頷句啄，向風搖翅，乃因風飛急疾，擊鳩、鴿、燕、雀食之。陬，子侯翻，隅也。句，古侯翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"「𪄟」，刘向说苑作「鹯」。字林曰：鹞属。陆玑曰：鹯似鹞，青黄色，燕颔句啄，向风摇翅，乃因风飞急疾，击鸠、鸽、燕、雀食之。陬，子侯翻，隅也。句，古侯翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"8ca437c5-db0e-11ef-92c6-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"史，太史之屬，掌卜筮者。","note_content_jianti_auto":"史，太史之属，掌卜筮者。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"8ca437cd-db0e-11ef-9def-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"凶人吉其凶。","note_content_jianti_auto":"凶人吉其凶。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"8ca437ce-db0e-11ef-b5f8-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"班","people_name_jianti_auto":"班","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8ca437d0-db0e-11ef-aa6b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孟嘗君","people_name_jianti_auto":"孟尝君","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"8ca437d1-db0e-11ef-96b0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"沛郡公丘縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"沛郡公丘县","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8ca437d2-db0e-11ef-b3fd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"滕國","place_name_jianti_auto":"滕国","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"8ca437d3-db0e-11ef-bae8-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"滕城","place_name_jianti_auto":"滕城","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"8ca437d4-db0e-11ef-99c5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蕃縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"蕃县","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"8ca437d5-db0e-11ef-992d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"滕縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"滕县","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"8ca437d6-db0e-11ef-bf13-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"徐州","place_name_jianti_auto":"徐州","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"8ca437d7-db0e-11ef-937c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"薛","place_name_jianti_auto":"薛","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"8ca437d8-db0e-11ef-9227-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"班志：沛郡公丘縣，古滕國。水經註：滕城在蕃縣西。唐志，滕縣屬徐州。薛卽孟嘗君所封地。蕃，音皮，又音如字。","note_content_jianti_auto":"班志：沛郡公丘县，古滕国。水经注：滕城在蕃县西。唐志，滕县属徐州。薛即孟尝君所封地。蕃，音皮，又音如字。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"8ca437cf-db0e-11ef-8c15-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"敗，補邁翻。亟，己力翻。射，而亦翻；後以義推。笞，擊也，音丑之翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"败，补迈翻。亟，己力翻。射，而亦翻；后以义推。笞，击也，音丑之翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":93,"tongjian_id":"8ca437dc-db0e-11ef-83e1-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"共工氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"共工氏","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8ca437de-db0e-11ef-809d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"句龍","people_name_jianti_auto":"句龙","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"8ca437df-db0e-11ef-a23b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"烈山氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"烈山氏","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"8ca437e0-db0e-11ef-8ac5-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"柱","people_name_jianti_auto":"柱","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"8ca437e1-db0e-11ef-8632-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"夏禹","people_name_jianti_auto":"夏禹